  speakerName: Lola Nida
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'When identifying or describing something specific, Ilokano can use
    ''isu ti'' as part of the sentence structure.

    For example, it can help express
    an idea similar to ''is the'' in English.

    Listen carefully: isu ti.

    Now,
    try saying ''isu ti'' yourself.'
